  "property_disclaimer": "<b>Disclaimer</b> - Property reference 101291013823. The information displayed about this property comprises a property advertisement. Rightmove.co.uk makes no warranty as to the accuracy or completeness of the advertisement or any linked or associated information, and Rightmove has no control over the content. This property advertisement does not constitute property particulars. The information is provided and maintained by <b>David Andrew, Archway</b>.&nbsp;Please contact the selling agent or developer directly to obtain any information which may be available under the terms of The Energy Performance of Buildings (Certificates and Inspections) (England and Wales) Regulations 2007 or the Home Report if in relation to a residential property in Scotland.",
  "property_phrase": "1 bedroom flat",
  "full_description": "A charming one-bedroom property set on the first floor of this period conversion, located moments from Finsbury Park station for easy access to and from central London. <br /><br />This property features a spacious open plan living/kitchen area, modern kitchen, a modern three-piece bathroom, wooden floor throughout, ample storage, high ceilings and gas central heating. With large windows facing both west and east for plenty of natural light throughout the day. <br /><br />Isledon Road is well-located for access to Finsbury Park (Piccadilly and Victoria lines and National rail lines), with a wealth of shops, gyms, cinemas, parks, cafes, bars, restaurants, and other amenities all within easy walking distance. Offered Part Furnished, Available Now.",
